+| `iS` | exit 0; `ev_ca3b95815c78c0aa04e56dcbe9138ba960daf6a820f244a9824fa8e0dad08537`; stdout SHA-256 `34494e4a421fdffa0d180e67a2bacb3aeda6a039bf1e8fc4312bf6045729f2cb` | `.ufo/waves/round-20/evidence/c2/rizin-pe/02-iS/receipt.json:1-14`; `02-iS/stdout.toon:21-29` |
